# skill-references.manifest
#
# Which repo-root / docs/ files get bundled into which skill's references/
# directory at install time. The `skills` npm CLI only ships files that
# live inside an individual skill directory, so anything a skill needs to
# read at runtime must be mirrored here and synced via
# scripts/sync-skill-references.sh.
#
# Format: one entry per line, whitespace-separated:
#     <source-path-relative-to-repo-root>  <consuming-skill-directory>
# Lines beginning with `#` and blank lines are ignored.

SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              help
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              correct-course
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              setup-ralph-loop
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              improve-pipeline
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              pre-merge
